Landsat Collection 2 Level-2 products: US Geological Survey.
https://www.usgs.gov/landsat-missions/landsat-collection-2-surface-temperature
Public-domain USGS data. Six geographic crops, rendered RGB and QA-masked surface-temperature display;
source product IDs, dates, grids, scales, offsets and QA rules accompany each sample.

Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2024).
Sentinel-2 L2A: four RGB/NIR scene pairs. Sentinel-1 RTC: four VV/VH scene pairs.
Accessed through Microsoft Planetary Computer. Cropped, reprojected/resampled and display-normalized.
https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice
Product IDs and acquisition dates are retained in data/manifest.json and measurement sidecars.

The source and public desktop packages exclude all model weights, personal imports, private reports,
training corpora and API keys. Local-only packages are personal copies, not cleared public releases.
